{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05178","headline":"道峡似巫山 · 朱使欣","name":"道峡似巫山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江如晓天静，石似暮云张。\n征帆一流览，宛若巫山阳。\n楚客思归路，秦人谪异乡。\n猨鸣孤月夜，再使泪沾裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱使欣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}